WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.160
- I have to start with this.

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.970
So, you gave a tour of
your house, recently

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.160
and mentioned a mommy juice wall.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:05.993
- Oh, God.

00:00:05.993 --> 00:00:07.211
- [Kelly] Which I'm into and I own.

00:00:07.211 --> 00:00:08.044
(Tia laughs)

00:00:08.044 --> 00:00:11.200
- Yeah so, MTV Cribs,
they came to my house

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.590
and I was showcasing my wall of wine.

00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:16.790
And my son, I have a ten-year-old

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.000
and he was actually doing
the interview with me

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.860
and he called me out.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.130
He said, "Mom, Mom, you got to,

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.560
you got to tell them,
you know, what happened".

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:25.040
I'm like, "What are you talking about?"

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.130
And he was like, "Remember,
last night you drank

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.749
the whole bottle of wine".

00:00:28.749 --> 00:00:30.819
(audience and Kelly laughs)

00:00:30.819 --> 00:00:31.940
- It's vitamins.

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.020
- I mean, but I call it like, mommy juice.

00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:35.630
- [Kelly] Yeah, It's good for
your heart, that's what I say.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.520
- It is, it's really great for your heart.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.359
- Even healthcare workers are into it.

00:00:39.359 --> 00:00:40.783
(audience applauds)
(Tia and Kelly laugh)

00:00:40.783 --> 00:00:41.770
- [Tia] But, yeah.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:43.950
- I love that your parent...
Our kids always out us,

00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.610
in the most awesome scenarios.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.210
- They always do, they're
honest, you know what I mean?

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:48.060
They're just honest people.

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.100
- [Kelly] Oh, they're
too honest, sometimes.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.509
I'm like, "Okay, you
can't say that to people".

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:53.260
Like, other people.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.759
But you love crime shows.
- I do, Oh my God.

00:00:55.759 --> 00:00:56.740
- [Kelly] All my friends love crime shows.

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:58.220
I am terrified of them.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:00:59.053
- [Tia] Really?

00:00:59.053 --> 00:01:01.500
- Yes, because I was into it for a minute

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.333
and then all of a sudden,

00:01:02.333 --> 00:01:04.060
I found myself just being paranoid.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:04.893
I was like, "They're going to come in.

00:01:04.893 --> 00:01:05.790
I know it's the third floor,

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:07.568
but they got in the third
floor in that one episode".

00:01:07.568 --> 00:01:08.630
(woman laughs)

00:01:08.630 --> 00:01:11.080
Like I start... So like,
what's the biggest crime

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.530
you ever personally, committed though?

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:13.363
Let's get really into it.

00:01:13.363 --> 00:01:16.263
- Oh my gosh, okay you
guys, this is an exclusive.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.090
So, my sister and I, you know,

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:21.400
we're kind of seen like, you
know, the perfect, you know,

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.410
twins and girls or whatever, but...

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:24.380
- [Kelly] Those are the ones you...

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:27.780
- Yeah, I know, but we were
actual cheaters, in school.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:28.613
- [Woman] Good work.

00:01:28.613 --> 00:01:30.410
- [Kelly] You know what? Way to be clever.

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:33.400
- You said good work.
(Tia laughs)

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.810
We would do, we would do this crazy thing

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:37.930
and I believe the teachers caught on,

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:39.630
because we couldn't sit next

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:42.530
to each other anymore, during like, exams.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:44.510
So my sister, she was,

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:46.720
she would be in front of
me, I would be behind her.

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:48.190
And then, if she wanted to know

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:50.240
the answer to question number one,

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:52.830
and if it was like, multiple
choice, if it was like A,

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:54.470
I would just kind of tap her, like that,

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:58.490
once for A and then two
for B and three for C.

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:00.444
- Wow, now that's just clever.
- I mean.

00:02:00.444 --> 00:02:01.277
(audience applauds)

00:02:01.277 --> 00:02:03.266
Sorry, kids don't do that.

00:02:03.266 --> 00:02:04.550
It's wrong, don't cheat.

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:05.507
- [Kelly] You know what though,

00:02:05.507 --> 00:02:06.946
when your kids start to
do it, you can't talk.

00:02:06.946 --> 00:02:07.930
(audience and Tia laugh)

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:09.080
You can't say anything.

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:12.100
Who else is going to confess to something?

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:13.210
Did you do something naughty?

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:15.223
- I was so, hoping you
weren't going to do that.

00:02:15.223 --> 00:02:17.295
(audience laughs)

00:02:17.295 --> 00:02:19.432
I'm just going to go...

00:02:19.432 --> 00:02:21.204
- You can talk about it on daytime.

00:02:21.204 --> 00:02:23.124
- I remember shoplifting
when I was like, 10.

00:02:23.124 --> 00:02:24.550
- [Woman] I'm so glad
you... That's what I was...

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:25.783
- I got, there was like...

00:02:25.783 --> 00:02:26.616
(audience laughs)

00:02:26.616 --> 00:02:29.260
There was like a greeting
card in this store,

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.560
in the mall, that had a photo

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.710
that looked exactly like the family dog.

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.396
And I was just like, "No one will notice

00:02:35.396 --> 00:02:37.060
if I just put this in my jacket".

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.727
And my parents got so
mad at me and I was like,

00:02:39.727 --> 00:02:42.340
"I thought this was just a fun, like..."

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.823
But they went at me for it.

00:02:43.823 --> 00:02:47.314
- You, okay...
(Kelly mumbles)

00:02:47.314 --> 00:02:49.943
What you stole, was a greeting card?

00:02:49.943 --> 00:02:50.776
(audience laughs)

00:02:50.776 --> 00:02:53.290
- Yeah and by the way, though,
my parents were mad at me,

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:56.452
it is still on the refrigerator
at my parent's house.

00:02:56.452 --> 00:02:57.840
(audience applauds)

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.120
- [Tia] Oh my God, that's hilarious.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.450
- Wait, so you're not going to own one?

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.880
- Yeah, no, I just think,

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:04.663
I'm just generally quite, light-fingered.

00:03:04.663 --> 00:03:05.630
(audience and guests laughs)

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:08.730
I call it, "Lovingly re-homing".

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.740
(audience laughs)
- [Kelly] Oh, my God.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:13.234
- You know, don't steal from individuals.

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.770
Just like, you know, hotels.

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:16.920
- Oh, okay.
(audience laughs)

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.210
- You're like Ross on friends,

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:20.260
where he's like, "It's
free, it's in the room".

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:22.750
- Exactly, if it's not
screwed down, I'm having it.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.300
- [Kelly] Oh my God, I love it.

